sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant E as 员工(Electron main.js)
    participant API as 桥服务 _save_page
    participant SN as enrich_snapshot
    participant LV as review_levels
    participant BM as book_meta
    participant PC as page_consistency
    participant BATCH as pipeline_batch
    participant EN as enrich_service
    participant VL as vlm_hybrid
    participant TAX as knowledge_taxonomy
    participant AV as analysis_verifier
    participant SP as sampling
    participant DW as delivery_workspace

    Note over E,DW: (0) 书级门禁 G0 + 书名解析 G0b
    BATCH->>BM: guess_book_metadata(书名, 目录)
    BM-->>E: 学科/学段/年级/学期 候选 + confidence
    E->>API: 确认书级字段（一次/书）
    API->>BM: validate_book_metadata_revision(project)
    API-->>BATCH: book_meta_rev（变化则整本 stale）

    Note over E,DW: (1) 人工确认一次，唯一的人工输入动作
    E->>API: 保存并确认本页(records 框/题号/text/answer)
    API->>API: 白名单构造记录(665-696) + save_project
    loop 每条 region_role=question
        API->>SN: freeze_or_invalidate(project, page, record, old)
        SN->>SN: page_sha1 + hash_of(snapshot 含 book_meta_rev)
        SN-->>API: snapshot 或 stale 标记
        API->>LV: compute_review_level(record, page, ctx)
        LV-->>API: (level, reasons)
    end
    API-->>E: warnings 本页风险 N 条 + review_summary

    Note over BATCH,DW: (2) 离线批处理，无人值守，可断点续跑
    BATCH->>BATCH: stage_cut 调 _question_suggestions 串行推理
    BATCH->>BATCH: stage_images layout_arbiter.image_regions + assign_owner + hard_reject
    BATCH->>PC: stage_consistency check_page + book_density_stats
    PC-->>BATCH: major_sequence_gap / page_density_outlier 告警
    BATCH->>EN: stage_enrich concurrency=4
    loop 每条待补全记录
        EN->>EN: cache_key(snapshot, image_shas, taxonomy_version, book_meta_rev)
        alt 缓存命中
            EN-->>EN: 复用结果 ai_cached
        else 未命中
            EN->>VL: analyze_json_call(拼图, prompt)
            VL->>VL: _prepare_image + _request 重试 1s/2s/4s
            VL-->>EN: JSON dict 或 None
        end
        EN->>TAX: validate(knowledge_points)
        TAX-->>EN: accepted + rejected
        EN->>AV: verify(record, snapshot)
        AV-->>EN: status + checks
        EN-->>BATCH: EnrichmentResult 或 rejected 或 failed
    end
    BATCH->>LV: stage_levels 全量重算 + check_difficulty_distribution
    BATCH->>SP: build_sample(L1) + resolve_sampling_scope(batch 或 stratum)

    Note over DW: (3) 交付门禁 G8
    DW->>DW: _k12_validation 加严 + review_level + 难度值域一致性 + suspected_missing
    alt book_meta_dirty 或存在 L2 未复核
        DW-->>E: 拒绝出包 + 具体原因进 quality_report
    else 通过
        DW-->>E: dataset.jsonl + quality_report.json
    end

    Note over SP: (4) 零缺陷验收与两级退化
    E->>SP: 提交抽检结论(封闭 error_class)
    SP->>SP: accept_or_reject 0 缺陷放行，1 缺陷即停
    SP->>SP: degrade_batch 本批 L0 全降 L2 且不出包
    SP->>SP: 全检同类错>=3 才 escalate_stratum 回溯该层
    SP->>SP: build_recall + build_patch + affected_customer_packages（绝不改历史包）
